{{ company_board | tojson }}
```

{% if rotated_board %}
## Rotated Board (from Falstaffian Rotation — the corrected competitive framing)

```json
{{ rotated_board | tojson }}
```

The Business Franchise pillar MUST reflect this rotated competitive framing, not the raw Company Board's framing. If the rotation revealed that an entity the analyst called a "competitor" is actually a market creator or complement, the moat assessment must reflect that. If the rotation revealed an asymmetry of need, the durability assessment must reflect that.
{% endif %}

